  "name": "Issue 3562: Steam Conjurer casts Wild Steam off Weapon Engraving: Earth damage",
  "contract": [
    "Steam Conjurer 805743 reads a 5% chance for Weapon Engraving: Earth damage to cast Wild Steam, once per 3 s.",
    "Authentic Spell.dbc gives ProcChance 5. Merged PR #5328 adds triggered damage eligibility and a 3000 ms ICD;",
    "its Chance 0 preserves that DBC chance. Earth Engraving 653219 grants proc aura 653221, whose native rolls",
    "cast Earth damage 653272. Earthen Fists still raises the engraving chance from 15 to 65 at five stacks.",
    "Eight targets and controlled melee/spell hit make eligible Earth events frequent. Native observations count",
    "only 805743 rolls caused by 653272, after cooldown, event, condition, script, effect and equipment gates.",
    "Combat stops after the first actual Steam proc or at least 270 eligible rolls, then requires a real proc",
    "and Wild Steam damage. All observed roll chances must remain 5. Conditional on 270 independent eligible",
    "5% rolls, zero successes has probability 0.95^270 ~= 9.67e-7. Expected stopping cost is about 20 rolls.",
    "An insufficient sample at the 540 s polling deadline fails setup; it does not establish that probability.",
    "The no-talent control requires Earth damage but no Steam proc or Wild Steam damage. Direct learning is a",
    "fixture and does not test talent acquisition. Earthen Fists expires normally; no RNG or ICD is changed."
  ],
